# Smoke: add one objective to an existing baseline and accept it.
id: objectives-smoke
skill: highway-objectives
fixture: setup
smoke: yes
open: /highway-objectives
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [edit] Add an objective: grow repeat customers by a fifth within a year, measured by the share of monthly orders placed by returning customers.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask-pattern: \?
say: [accept] Yes, that's right.
writes: library/governance/objectives.md
writes: library/objectives/*.md
expect: template library/governance/objectives.md :: objective-catalog.md
expect: template library/objectives/*.md :: objective-record.md
expect: contains library/objectives/*.md :: repeat
